@startuml 4-5-touristagency-reservation-SM
' STM-01 Stanja rezervacije (Reservation.status, enum ReservationStatus)
' Zahtjevi: FR-09, FR-10, FR-13, FR-22. Prijelazi su zapisani kao: događaj [uvjet] / akcija
mainframe stm STM-01 Stanja rezervacije
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> CONFIRMED : book(...)\n[ima dovoljno slobodnih mjesta]\n/ ReservationConfirmedEvent

state CONFIRMED : status = 'CONFIRMED'\nračuna se u zauzeta mjesta termina
state CANCELLED : status = 'CANCELLED'\nne računa se u zauzeta mjesta
state COMPLETED : status = 'COMPLETED'\nračuna se u statistiku i prihod

CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancelReservation(id, userId)\n[vlasnik i termin još nije počeo]\n/ ReservationCancelledEvent
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancelReservationAsAdmin(id)\n/ ReservationCancelledEvent
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : completeFinishedReservations()\n[@Scheduled svakih 60 s,\ntermin_kraj <= now]

CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of CANCELLED
  Otkazana ili gotova rezervacija
  ne može se ponovno otkazati
  (409 RESERVATION_NOT_CANCELLABLE).
end note

note bottom of CONFIRMED
  Otkazivanje termina ili izleta
  (TripService.cancelSession / deleteTrip)
  trenutno ne mijenja status rezervacija.
end note
@enduml
